{"availability":"available","full":"WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto","name":"redacto","description":"Make private info disappear before AI sees it. Redact PDFs, Word, Excel, images and text entirely in your browser. No uploads.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T19:39:34Z","updated":"2026-10-08T22:23:25Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://redacto.cc","topics":["anonymization","local-first","pii","privacy","react","redaction","transformers-js"],"demo":"https://redacto.cc/app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:49.904Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:49.904Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:49.904Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:03.289Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108360074934542751","postId":"2108360074934542751","postedAt":"2026-10-09T00:53:07.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:04:13.182Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:55:03.289Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T19:08:49.904Z","stars":8,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Make private info disappear before AI sees it.","Remove names, addresses, account numbers and 50+ other kinds of personal data from PDFs, Word, Excel, images and text, entirely in your browser. Nothing is uploaded.","You ask ChatGPT, Claude or Grok \"What should I be concerned about?\" and attach your lab results. The AI needs the numbers. It doesn't need your name, birthday, patient ID, address or doctor, but it gets all of them, and they're stored on someone else's servers."],"features":["Every common format: PDF (including scans, via OCR), Word, Excel, CSV/TSV, PNG/JPG and plain text.","AI plus rules: a local PII model finds names, places and context; checksum-validated patterns catch emails,","phone numbers, SSNs, credit cards, IBANs, IPs, dates, addresses, ZIP codes and ID numbers.","You stay in control: review every finding, keep what you need, redact anything by selecting it or dragging","a box on the page. Undo and redo."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"63c0ca800b794a5f734480b6ccbcc11cedb730db4024b74fa0576bd254b85040","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.719Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:03.289Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Make private info disappear before AI sees it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no tracking, no cookies.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"63c0ca800b794a5f734480b6ccbcc11cedb730db4024b74fa0576bd254b85040","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:03.289Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T22:23:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WannaBeSolopreneur/redacto/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:03.289Z","hash":"63c0ca800b794a5f734480b6ccbcc11cedb730db4024b74fa0576bd254b85040","originalBytes":14859,"storedBytes":14859,"truncated":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://redacto.cc/app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","target":"https://redacto.cc/app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T09:40:02.556Z"},"previewCheck":{"url":"https://redacto.cc/app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T09:40:02.556Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/6755a31803dcbda51402425c.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","url":"https://redacto.cc/